SOLUTION 1 River
    units mg/L
    pH 6.0
    Cl 10
    -water 1
SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    units mg/L
    pH 8.1
    Cl 19000
    -water 1
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
SAVE solution 3
END
USE solution 3
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_visc.sel
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -user_punch true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings viscosity_cP
10 PUNCH VISCOSITY*1000
END
